    "若已为最大排列则变为最小升序排列；保留元素及重复次数，原地修改且只用常数额外空间。"
  ],
  "constraints_html": "<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 100</code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>",
  "source": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/2104ae8bdd661a1ebb6b5c703f050b8060b51e32/solution/0000-0099/0031.Next%20Permutation/README.md",
